{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-job-8-1","title":"Job 8:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Bildad shews God's justice in dealing with men according to their works. 8 He alleges antiquity to prove the certain destruction of the hypocrite. 20 He applies God's just dealing to Job.</p>\n<p>Bildad. 2:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-8-2","title":"Job 8:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>How long. 11:2,3; 16:3; 18:2; 19:2,3; Ex 10:3,7; Pr 1:22 the words. 6:9,26; 7:11; 15:2; 1Ki 19:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-8-3","title":"Job 8:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>God. 4:17; 9:2; 10:3; 19:7; 34:5,12,17-19; 40:8; Ge 18:25; De 32:4 2Ch 19:7; Eze 18:25; 33:17,20; Ps 89:14; Da 9:14; Ro 2:5; 3:4-6 Almighty. 21:15,20; 34:10-12; 35:13; 40:2; Ps 99:4; Re 15:3; 16:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-8-4","title":"Job 8:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>he have cast. 1:5,18,19; 5:4; 18:16-19; Ge 13:13; 19:13-25 for their transgression. Heb. in the hand of theirtransgression.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-8-5","title":"Job 8:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>thou wouldest. 5:8; 11:13; 22:21-23,24-30; 2Ch 33:12,13; Isa 55:6,7; Mt 7:7,8 Heb 3:7,8; Jas 4:7-10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-8-6","title":"Job 8:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>thou wert. 1:8; 4:6,7; 21:14,15; 16:17; Ps 26:5,6; Pr 15:8; Isa 1:15; 1Ti 2:8 1Jo 3:19-22 he would. Ps 44:23; 59:4,5; Isa 51:9 make. 22:23-30; Isa 3:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-8-7","title":"Job 8:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>thy beginning. 42:12,13; Pr 4:18; Zec 4:10; Mt 13:12,31,32 thy latter. De 8:16; Pr 19:20; Zec 14:7; 2Pe 2:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-8-8","title":"Job 8:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>enquire. 12:12; 15:10,18; 32:6,7; De 4:32; 32:7; Ps 44:1; 78:3,4; Isa 38:19 Ro 15:4; 1Co 10:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-8-9","title":"Job 8:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>we are but. 7:6; Ge 47:9; 1Ch 29:15; Ps 39:5; 90:4; 102:11; 144:4 nothing. Heb. not.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-8-10","title":"Job 8:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>Shall not. 12:7,8; 32:7; De 6:7; 11:19; Ps 145:4; Heb 11:4; 12:1 utter words. Pr 16:23; 18:15; Mt 12:35</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-8-11","title":"Job 8:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>the rush. Ex 2:3; Isa 19:5-7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-8-12","title":"Job 8:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>Ps 129:6,7; Jer 17:6; Mt 13:20; Jas 1:10,11; 1Pe 1:24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-8-13","title":"Job 8:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>that forget God. De 6:12; 8:11,14,19; Ps 9:17; 10:4; 50:22; Isa 51:13 the hypocrite's. 11:20; 13:16; 15:34; 18:14; 20:5; 27:8-10; 36:13; Pr 10:28; 12:7 Isa 33:14; La 3:18; Mt 24:51; Lu 12:1,2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-8-14","title":"Job 8:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>web. Heb. house. Isa 59:5,6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-8-15","title":"Job 8:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>it shall not stand. 18:14; 27:18; Ps 52:5-7; 112:10; Pr 10:28; Mt 7:24-27; Lu 6:47-49</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-8-16","title":"Job 8:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>green. 21:7-15; Ps 37:35,36; 73:3-12 his branch. 5:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-8-17","title":"Job 8:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>roots. 18:16; 29:19; Isa 5:24; 40:24; Jer 12:1,2; Mr 11:20; Jude 1:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-8-18","title":"Job 8:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>he. 7:10; 20:9; Ps 37:10,36; 73:18,19; 92:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-8-19","title":"Job 8:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>this is the joy. 20:5; Mt 13:20,21 out of the earth. 1Sa 2:8; Ps 75:7; 113:7; Eze 17:24; Mt 3:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-8-20","title":"Job 8:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>God. 4:7; 9:22; Ps 37:24,37; 94:14 help the evil doers. Heb. take the ungodly by the hand. Isa 45:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-8-21","title":"Job 8:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>he fill. Ge 21:6; Ps 126:2,6; Lu 6:21 rejoicing. Heb. shouting for joy. Ezr 3:11-13; Ne 12:43; Ps 32:11; 98:4; 100:1; Isa 65:13,14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-8-22","title":"Job 8:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>clothed. Ps 35:26; 109:29; 132:18; 1Pe 5:5 come to nought. Heb. not be. 18; 7:21</p>"}]}